{'symbol': 'WBA', 'date': '2021-09-24 09:51:00', 'title': 'WALGREENS ANNOUNCES PFIZER COVID-19 VACCINE BOOSTER SHOTS NOW AVAILABLE NATIONWIDE FOR ELIGIBLE INDIVIDUALS', 'text': 'DEERFIELD, ILL.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--WALGREENS ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT ELIGIBLE INDIVIDUALS CAN NOW RECEIVE PFIZER COVID-19 BOOSTER VACCINATIONS IN STORES NATIONWIDE, FOLLOWING FOOD AND DRUG ADMINISTRATION (FDA) EMERGENCY USE AUTHORIZATION AND NEW GUIDANCE FROM THE CENTERS FOR DISEASE CONTROL AND PREVENTION (CDC). “WALGREENS HAS PLAYED A VITAL ROLE IN RESPONDING TO COVID-19 AS MILLIONS HAVE TURNED TO US AS A CONVENIENT VACCINATION DESTINATION AND CRITICAL POINT OF COMMUNITY CARE,” SAID JOHN STANDLEY,'}